  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training longsword fighter's combat with the player's own iron longsword attacks (the older weapon set: no signature energy). Basic = Longsword_Attack (swing left, right, up-left). Charged = the same Longsword_Attack held: ChargeFor 1.565 = its only charge key (Longsword_Stab_Charged). Guard = Longsword_Block after taking damage. Every action carries Weapon_Longsword_Iron's interaction vars, plus Longsword_Block_Damage with the game's own default. Two-handed: no off hand. Kept distances: the role's MaintainDistance takes its range from each action's PostExecuteDistanceRange, so they all stay inside the basic attack's reach (strafe 2.5-4 kept it out of reach, staring at its rival); basic attack Timeout 0.5 lets it finish aiming instead of losing the try and waiting a cooldown.",
